WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,680
Your son is Huo Yan

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,960
My Huo family is not something you can mess with.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,280
It's best to always explain

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,720
Imperial Capital Huo Family

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,080
Life is stuck in my hands

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:14,970
He could suppress the wealthy family because he didn't do anything and kicked him.

7
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,370
Trampled and broke his arm

8
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,870
He probably doesn't remember

9
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,670
Break his hands and feet for me

10
